# 破坏性重构（2026-10）临时物：构建垃圾、本地库重置产物、临时文档。
swbuild.tmp.*
.gather/
*.sqlite.incompatible-*
docs/reviews/*.tmp.md

.env*
*.log
.coverage
coverage/
test-results/
